WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.672
Location sharing is always controlled by the customer.

2
00:00:03.672 --> 00:00:10.558
Open Privacy and Access, choose the vehicle, duration, and support purpose, then grant temporary access.

3
00:00:10.558 --> 00:00:16.984
When the portal switches to reseller support, the granted map shows only approved vehicles.

4
00:00:16.984 --> 00:00:23.870
Other customer locations remain protected, and the access event is available to the audit trail.
